<task id="059" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Implement I5 concurrency guard — same-customer serialization via sprk_currentrunid optimistic upsert</title>
    <phase>C Wave C5 — L2 REST + Reconciler</phase>
    <gate>cleared</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'l2-controlplane','job-handler','dataverse'; enforces §4D I5 tenant-isolation invariant + FR-23 concurrency guard; a bug here allows same-customer double-provision.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Well-scoped optimistic-concurrency implementation over a single Dataverse column (sprk_currentrunid); requires careful reasoning through all race windows. Step 3.5.5b sonnet @ xhigh justified per complex brownfield criteria (must trace every place the column is read/written).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
